		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Augment: Fuel Efficiency and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
